# Each profile keeps its own Shields (22 Nov 2026: what one profile set showed in every other, so
# switching spaces carried one profile's choices into the next). Personal is on Default, as it
# comes (Trackers on, Optimal); Random is on the profile Hobbies, set to Trackers off and Basic.
# A page in each does what its own profile says, before and after the other one is used, and a
# site choice made in one stays in it.
# promise: #18
port 8132
budget rss=800 stalls50=20
